tinacloud-project-list(1) -- List projects
==========================================

## DESCRIPTION

List all projects for the given organization ID.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud project list`

## OPTIONS

  * `--org-id`:
    TinaCloud organization ID

  * `--json`:
    Print the result as JSON

  * `--tina-dir`:
    Path to the tina folder (default "tina")

## EXAMPLES

	$ tinacloud project list --org-id 1e1d3398-8255-4812-9f67-388993734a01

